This product includes no third-party code. The following were consulted as
reference implementations while implementing SNMPv3 and USM — for the interop
workarounds and state-machine detail that the RFCs do not specify — and are
credited here because their licences are attribution-based:

  - gosnmp (https://github.com/gosnmp/gosnmp) — SNMPv3 USM, engine discovery
    and vendor interop workarounds. BSD-3-Clause.
  - async-snmp (https://github.com/lukeod/async-snmp) — async USM structure and
    fuzzing approach. MIT OR Apache-2.0.

Testing uses snmp-fault-agent (https://github.com/lcmscheid/snmp-fault-agent),
Apache-2.0, consumed by CI as a container image and not linked into this
library.
